WEBVTT

00:02.980 --> 00:05.000
Level 99?

00:03.920 --> 00:05.000
99? Seriously?

00:05.000 --> 00:06.490
That can't be right...

00:05.810 --> 00:07.090
Level 99...

00:07.090 --> 00:10.210
99? I've never heard of anyone that high.

00:16.270 --> 00:20.490
<i>Shoot... I had no idea 
my level was that high.</i>

00:20.810 --> 00:24.430
It must be an error.
Bring us the backup magic tool.

00:24.430 --> 00:25.650
Y-Yes, sir.

00:29.820 --> 00:33.430
Miss Yumiella Dolkness, try it one more time.

00:38.920 --> 00:41.190
It's still level 99.

00:41.190 --> 00:42.280
For real?

00:41.790 --> 00:43.310
Level 99...

00:42.280 --> 00:43.310
What's going on?

00:44.840 --> 00:49.450
Miss Yumiella, did you have
any idea your level was this high?

00:49.900 --> 00:52.760
<i>I can't hide it any longer.
I guess I'll have to run with it.</i>

00:53.370 --> 00:56.950
Yes, I believe the reading is correct.

00:57.440 --> 00:59.470
There's no problem with 
the magic tool itself.

00:59.470 --> 01:02.320
You tampered with it somehow, didn't you?

01:02.320 --> 01:05.370
No, I believe level 99 is correct.

01:06.650 --> 01:11.260
You might not know this, but levels 
only go up when you kill monsters!

01:11.260 --> 01:13.930
We know you're lying. Just tell us the truth.

01:14.410 --> 01:16.430
<i>I have been killing them, though...</i>

01:20.680 --> 01:22.540
She can kill monsters?

01:22.850 --> 01:24.310
No way.

01:24.310 --> 01:25.690
Quiet!

01:25.970 --> 01:28.470
Everyone, just calm down.

01:28.470 --> 01:33.090
We'll see whether she's telling the 
truth or not once classes begin.

01:33.090 --> 01:37.130
Miss Yumiella, please give your 
greeting and return to your seat.

01:40.160 --> 01:43.560
<i>Oh? Looks like the principal doubts me, too.</i>

01:45.580 --> 01:49.210
I am Yumiella Dolkness. 
Pleased to meet all of you.

01:49.420 --> 01:51.050
She must have cheated somehow, right?

01:51.050 --> 01:52.090
She's a fraud.

01:52.380 --> 01:55.330
<i>Worst case, I'll have
to flee the country alone.</i>

01:55.640 --> 01:59.100
<i>Even out in the sticks, I'm sure I 
can get by with just my strength.</i>

01:59.340 --> 02:01.770
We will continue to assess your levels.

02:03.280 --> 02:04.600
Patrick Ashbatten.

02:05.990 --> 02:06.790
Yes, ma'am.

02:08.090 --> 02:11.560
<i>I expected Alicia to stand out due 
to being the only commoner here,</i>

02:12.110 --> 02:14.820
<i>but in the end, she never drew any 
particular attention to herself.</i>

02:15.430 --> 02:18.100
<i>Sorry for stealing the show, protagonist.</i>

02:43.260 --> 02:46.890
<b>Villainess Level 99</b>

02:43.580 --> 02:46.890
I May Be the Hidden Boss but I'm Not the Demon Lord

03:58.510 --> 04:01.640
<i>So the entrance ceremony is 
followed by a buffet party?</i>

04:03.170 --> 04:06.030
<i>Not that there's anyone I know here,</i>

04:06.030 --> 04:09.140
<i>nor anyone who'd want to hang out with me.</i>

04:09.780 --> 04:13.340
<i>And I don't want to stand out, 
so I'll just leave early.</i>

04:19.330 --> 04:21.520
Hey, you with the black hair!

04:22.360 --> 04:24.620
You're name's Yumiella Dolkness, right?

04:24.620 --> 04:26.580
What trick did you use back there?

04:27.200 --> 04:29.080
<i>Now I've got this pain 
in the neck on my case.</i>

04:29.450 --> 04:32.990
Um... Are you talking about 
the level assessment?

04:32.990 --> 04:34.090
Obviously!

04:34.740 --> 04:38.560
I get wanting to stand out,
but have you no pride as a noble?

04:38.910 --> 04:40.340
Relax, Will.

04:41.580 --> 04:45.850
I understand how you feel, but this 
isn't the place to make a fuss.

04:46.530 --> 04:48.880
A pleasure to meet you, Prince Edwin.

04:48.880 --> 04:51.120
I am Yumiella Dolkness.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.480
The daughter of Count Dolkness...

04:53.890 --> 04:55.480
Central wannabe.

04:57.190 --> 04:58.770
Miss Yumiella,

04:58.770 --> 05:01.140
I know that Will has worked 
harder than anyone else

05:01.140 --> 05:03.870
at sword training since he was a child.

05:04.270 --> 05:08.150
That's how he reached level 10 
before he entered this school.

05:08.510 --> 05:12.880
And what you did trampled all 
over his hard-earned achievement.

05:13.310 --> 05:14.080
Ah...

05:15.090 --> 05:19.840
<i>Why does everyone just assume that I cheated?</i>

05:20.220 --> 05:23.890
<i>Not that I can blame them for 
being suspicious, I guess.</i>

05:24.640 --> 05:27.870
It's true that I'm level 99.

05:27.870 --> 05:29.990
As the principal said,

05:29.990 --> 05:33.050
I'm confident you'll see 
that once classes begin.

05:33.050 --> 05:36.270
Hmph. Still keeping up the 
innocent act, are you?

05:36.270 --> 05:39.200
Are you saying you're stronger than me?

05:39.200 --> 05:42.780
You'd better be glad I don't 
have my gloves right now!

05:42.780 --> 05:48.480
Honestly, level 99? 
That's not realistic at all.

05:49.160 --> 05:51.790
Couldn't you come up with 
a more believable lie?

05:52.350 --> 05:55.540
<i>All three of the conquerable 
characters are here.</i>

05:55.920 --> 05:57.540
<i>Edwin Valschein.</i>

05:57.540 --> 06:01.160
<i>This kingdom's second prince, 
and the game's main hero.</i>

06:01.160 --> 06:04.050
<i>A magic swordsman,
user of both blades and spells.</i>

06:04.710 --> 06:06.030
<i>William Ares.</i>

06:06.370 --> 06:11.060
<i>A musclehead with a strong sense 
of justice and a short temper.</i>

06:11.770 --> 06:13.690
<i>Oswald Grimsarde.</i>

06:13.690 --> 06:17.310
<i>A magic prodigy, and the 
"cool-headed glasses guy" type.</i>

06:18.400 --> 06:20.850
<i>The three of them are friends, as well.</i>

06:20.850 --> 06:25.070
<i>I never had any interest in them.</i>

06:25.510 --> 06:28.420
<i>For the sake of avoiding any 
connection to the game's story,</i>

06:28.420 --> 06:31.080
<i>I'd rather avoid contact with them.</i>

06:31.540 --> 06:34.090
Well? Got anything to say for yourself?

06:34.090 --> 06:37.270
It seems as if you wouldn't 
believe anything I said, anyway.

06:37.270 --> 06:39.290
You're still talking like that?!

06:39.290 --> 06:42.040
If you're going to lie, be better at it.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.730
If you insist it's true,

06:43.730 --> 06:47.360
why don't you show us your level 
99 magic right here and now?

06:48.430 --> 06:50.510
<i>He clearly didn't think this through.</i>

06:50.510 --> 06:54.170
<i>I don't mind showing them, but I don't 
want to create an even bigger commotion.</i>

06:54.890 --> 07:01.020
Uh... Speaking of magic, I understand 
there's a commoner here who uses light magic.

07:01.020 --> 07:02.610
Right there, in fact.

07:03.440 --> 07:07.890
She seems to be struggling, being in a 
new, unfamiliar place with no friends.

07:08.470 --> 07:11.030
Why don't you go and talk to her?

07:11.800 --> 07:15.540
True. There's no need for us 
to listen to your nonsense.

07:15.850 --> 07:18.500
And we'll see the truth 
once classes start, right?

07:18.880 --> 07:22.020
I look forward to seeing how 
the school deals with you.

07:31.170 --> 07:33.810
Prince Edwin! Oz! William!

07:34.130 --> 07:35.690
Hi, Alicia.

07:35.690 --> 07:38.060
What, you guys know her?

07:39.600 --> 07:41.320
<i>I'm so exhausted.</i>

07:42.390 --> 07:45.560
You're home quite early, Miss Yumiella.

07:45.560 --> 07:47.820
The party isn't over yet, is it?

07:49.070 --> 07:52.570
It's fine. There's no one I can 
see myself becoming friends with.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.650
<i>This is Rita,</i>

07:54.650 --> 07:58.630
<i>the maid sent by my father to look 
after me while he's in the capital.</i>

07:58.630 --> 08:02.040
You'll never find a good partner that way.

08:02.040 --> 08:04.510
That will trouble the master, as well.

08:04.870 --> 08:07.590
<i>It seems she's also here as 
an overseer to ensure that</i>

08:07.590 --> 08:11.650
<i>I don't act out of line and that 
I find a marriage partner quickly,</i>

08:11.650 --> 08:13.650
<i>as well as to report back to Father about me.</i>

08:14.130 --> 08:18.230
I hear the second prince, Edwin, 
is among your classmates.

08:18.570 --> 08:23.600
<i>Yes, and said second prince seems to 
have a very negative impression of me.</i>

08:24.210 --> 08:28.240
<i>Wait, she doesn't know about the 
commotion my level caused, then?</i>

08:28.240 --> 08:30.520
<i>What kind of overseer are you?</i>

08:31.530 --> 08:34.620
Say, do you know what 
"central wannabe" means?

08:37.250 --> 08:39.520
Someone called you that, I take it?

08:39.520 --> 08:41.880
It's nothing you need to 
concern yourself with.

08:42.100 --> 08:45.130
I never said anyone called me that.

08:47.450 --> 08:50.170
So it does refer to the Dolkness family.

08:50.870 --> 08:54.790
You are familiar with the "central 
nobles" and "regional nobles," yes?

08:54.790 --> 08:57.710
Yes. We're regional nobles, right?

08:57.710 --> 09:01.650
Since we don't hold any special 
position in the capital.

09:01.930 --> 09:02.800
Yes.

09:03.280 --> 09:07.980
"Central wannabe" refers to regional nobles

09:07.980 --> 09:11.030
who spend all their time in the capital, 
even though they hold no position there.

09:11.530 --> 09:12.580
Ah.

09:13.430 --> 09:16.260
So it refers to useless nobles 
who spend all their time

09:16.260 --> 09:18.990
goofing off in the capital, 
but doing no real work there,

09:18.990 --> 09:21.040
while leaving their domains in 
the hands of local governors?

09:21.290 --> 09:23.920
U-Um...

09:28.250 --> 09:30.520
<i>Classes began the next day.</i>

09:33.150 --> 09:35.660
<i>I'm completely isolated in the classroom.</i>

09:35.660 --> 09:38.310
<i>But, you know, this might 
actually make things easier.</i>

09:39.050 --> 09:42.450
<i>It might not be so bad to be part
of the decor for the next three years.</i>

09:42.450 --> 09:44.690
Look, it's that black-haired girl.

09:44.690 --> 09:47.810
She claims she's level 99.

09:47.810 --> 09:50.500
She might be not quite right in the head.

09:52.730 --> 09:56.580
<i>My hearing has leveled up significantly 
as well, so I can hear every word.</i>

09:56.990 --> 10:00.910
<i>They want me to prove that 
I'm level 99 that badly?</i>

10:00.910 --> 10:05.080
Wow, so light magic can heal 
people who are sick or hurt, too?

10:05.460 --> 10:08.090
We might be needing your help, then.

10:08.360 --> 10:12.850
The old lady you helped out came 
to the school to thank you.

10:12.850 --> 10:16.230
I would have opened the gate for 
if you'd told me what happened.

10:16.230 --> 10:19.240
So, do you think you'll get 
along okay at the academy?

10:19.240 --> 10:21.520
To be honest, I'm a little worried.

10:21.520 --> 10:23.630
I'm a commoner, after all.

10:23.630 --> 10:26.940
If anything happens, come 
straight to us, all right?

10:26.940 --> 10:28.570
We'll help you out.

10:30.270 --> 10:32.100
<i>Today's the first day of classes.</i>

10:32.100 --> 10:36.010
<i>If this was playing out like the game, 
Alicia wouldn't be close to those three yet.</i>

10:36.320 --> 10:39.450
<i>Yet they're already such good friends.</i>

10:41.510 --> 10:46.630
<i>Did the story change because 
I sent them to her?</i>

10:47.510 --> 10:49.370
<i>Alicia Ehnleit.</i>

10:47.620 --> 10:52.580
Alicia

10:47.620 --> 10:52.580
I can use light magic!

10:49.370 --> 10:51.900
<i>A very rare user of light magic.</i>

10:52.440 --> 10:56.130
<i>That's why she was allowed to enter the 
academy, even though she's a commoner.</i>

10:53.150 --> 10:56.130
Alicia

10:53.150 --> 10:56.130
So this is the Royal Academy...

10:56.850 --> 11:00.210
<i>Light magic is dark magic's only weakness,</i>

11:00.210 --> 11:02.640
<i>so she could be a trump card 
against the Demon Lord.</i>

11:03.440 --> 11:07.240
<i>Although no one has told her about that yet.</i>

11:12.630 --> 11:14.780
<i>That same reaction again...</i>

11:20.630 --> 11:21.660
<i>Afternoon.</i>

11:22.250 --> 11:24.730
<i>Our first class was practical swordsmanship.</i>

11:26.010 --> 11:27.100
<i>This sword...</i>

11:27.470 --> 11:29.940
<i>It's made of wood, but it's real.</i>

11:29.940 --> 11:31.670
<i>The first one I've ever held...</i>

11:32.400 --> 11:35.830
<i>This reminds me of the souvenir toy 
sword I saw during a field trip.</i>

11:35.830 --> 11:38.410
<i>It was an item any gamer would want to have,</i>

11:38.410 --> 11:40.680
<i>but I couldn't afford it at the time.</i>

11:41.340 --> 11:43.620
You'll take turns fighting mock battles

11:43.620 --> 11:45.830
so that we can assess your skill levels.

11:45.830 --> 11:49.180
Up first is our level 99 student... you.

11:50.070 --> 11:52.360
I'll be her opponent, then.

12:00.560 --> 12:02.280
Master William!

12:02.280 --> 12:04.080
Good luck!

12:07.240 --> 12:10.460
<i>So... how should I hold back against him?</i>

12:13.120 --> 12:14.560
Master William!

12:14.560 --> 12:15.960
Get her!

12:18.550 --> 12:20.590
<i>When I was killing monsters to level up,</i>

12:20.900 --> 12:22.600
<i>I mainly used magic,</i>

12:23.270 --> 12:25.980
<i>but my physical attacks are 
also incredibly strong.</i>

12:26.870 --> 12:29.080
What's wrong, you fraud?

12:29.080 --> 12:31.100
If you wanna back out, now's the time.

12:33.030 --> 12:36.380
<i>Whether you live or die rides on 
my sense of subtlety, you know.</i>

12:37.370 --> 12:39.610
Both of you, take your positions!

12:43.360 --> 12:44.950
What kind of stance is that?

12:44.950 --> 12:46.360
Pathetic!

12:51.190 --> 12:53.030
C'mon, get into position already!

12:53.030 --> 12:55.250
Or are you gonna surrender without fighting?

12:55.600 --> 12:59.060
I'm sorry. It's my first time using a sword.

12:59.060 --> 13:01.050
We can begin just like this.

13:02.600 --> 13:04.590
How long are you gonna keep mocking me?!

13:04.590 --> 13:07.100
I won't go easy on you 
just 'cause you're a girl!

13:07.100 --> 13:10.060
Expect a broken bone or two!

13:12.000 --> 13:12.650
<i>He's slow.</i>

13:22.570 --> 13:26.370
<i>Sorry. I wasn't expecting you 
to take such a dramatic fall.</i>

13:28.830 --> 13:31.310
Sir, are we finished?

13:31.310 --> 13:33.160
Should I continue to attack?

13:33.160 --> 13:36.330
Th-The winner is Yumiella Dolkness.

13:36.330 --> 13:37.210
I'm not done!

13:37.520 --> 13:40.720
Pretending to be a beginner?!
Could you be any more of a coward?!

13:49.310 --> 13:51.460
<i>These are tougher than I thought.</i>

13:51.460 --> 13:52.700
<i>Wait, I mean...</i>

13:53.730 --> 13:55.490
<i>Is he okay?</i>

13:55.490 --> 13:56.730
<i>If anything happens to him,</i>

13:57.300 --> 14:01.610
<i>I'll pursue the teacher's 
responsibility as our supervisor.</i>

14:03.510 --> 14:05.120
<i>Looks like I'm safe.</i>

14:06.570 --> 14:09.870
Uh... Shall I carry him 
to the nurse's office?

14:10.120 --> 14:12.890
No, that's fine. I'll take him.

14:16.010 --> 14:20.100
All of you, do practice swings 
on your own until I come back.

14:20.100 --> 14:22.880
And no matches! Understand?!

14:23.350 --> 14:27.530
<i>If Alicia were here, she could 
heal him with light magic,</i>

14:28.050 --> 14:30.600
<i>but she was placed in another group.</i>

14:33.560 --> 14:35.650
<i>There's no need to be that scared.</i>

14:36.400 --> 14:39.090
<i>I held back quite a bit against William.</i>

14:39.570 --> 14:43.030
<i>The fact that he's not mincemeat 
right now proves it.</i>

14:43.800 --> 14:45.280
Practice swings, eh?

14:53.540 --> 14:58.880
<i>The teacher didn't return 
before the class period ended.</i>

15:02.090 --> 15:05.060
<i>Our next class was practical magic.</i>

15:05.630 --> 15:08.050
<i>We joined up with another group of students,</i>

15:08.610 --> 15:11.160
<i>but Edwin isn't among them.</i>

15:11.160 --> 15:13.570
<i>Which is fine with me. 
I want nothing to do with him.</i>

15:13.900 --> 15:17.910
First, let's have you all 
demonstrate your magic abilities.

15:17.910 --> 15:21.590
Since this is our first lesson, 
just hitting the target is good enough.

15:29.180 --> 15:35.750
<i>The four basic magic attributes 
are fire, wind, water, and earth.</i>

15:37.610 --> 15:42.070
<i>And then there are the very rare 
users of light and dark magic.</i>

15:43.710 --> 15:45.580
Wow, amazing!

15:45.580 --> 15:47.620
This is the first time I've 
ever seen light magic!

15:47.620 --> 15:49.720
Th-Thank you.

16:03.400 --> 16:05.790
Awesome...

16:03.930 --> 16:07.210
I expected no less from 
you, Oswald Grimsarde!

16:07.210 --> 16:10.150
You've mastered all four magic attributes.

16:10.150 --> 16:12.990
It's no wonder they call you a prodigy.

16:12.990 --> 16:15.590
Really, this is nothing.

16:16.180 --> 16:20.880
You're up next. What incredible 
magic will you show us?

16:21.410 --> 16:23.550
<i>He wasn't part of the previous class,</i>

16:23.550 --> 16:26.600
<i>so I guess he doesn't know 
I kicked William's butt.</i>

16:28.100 --> 16:33.050
<i>The truth is, I can't use the four 
basic attributes all that well.</i>

16:33.050 --> 16:35.390
<i>Yes, I am...</i>

16:36.000 --> 16:39.350
<i>a woman who's maxed out her 
talents in muscle and darkness.</i>

16:40.360 --> 16:44.770
Um, is it all right if we break the target?

16:44.770 --> 16:47.650
It's been specially made.

16:47.650 --> 16:52.080
And even I couldn't break
it. There's no way you can.

16:52.080 --> 16:56.290
You'd have to be as powerful 
as a palace mage to break that.

16:56.710 --> 17:00.720
Of course, you're welcome 
to break it if you can.

17:00.720 --> 17:02.270
Thank you.

17:02.960 --> 17:05.540
<i>As powerful as a palace mage, huh?</i>

17:06.290 --> 17:07.420
<i>Easy.</i>

17:07.750 --> 17:08.940
Dark Flame.

17:11.950 --> 17:13.840
I wondered what she'd use.

17:13.840 --> 17:15.180
It's just a peashooter.

17:15.550 --> 17:16.680
That's...

17:26.840 --> 17:28.250
<i>Dark Flame.</i>

17:28.250 --> 17:31.400
<i>It looks like fire, but it's not hot at all,</i>

17:31.920 --> 17:34.340
<i>and it easily melts both stone and metal.</i>

17:34.780 --> 17:37.550
<i>It's similar to sulfuric
or nitrohydrochloric acid,</i>

17:37.550 --> 17:40.630
<i>so when used on monsters, 
it's rather grotesque.</i>

17:42.620 --> 17:43.790
Was that really...

17:44.090 --> 17:46.150
Yes, it was dark magic.

17:46.480 --> 17:48.800
I can't use the other attributes at all.

17:50.260 --> 17:52.350
Th-That was brilliant.

17:52.350 --> 17:56.030
Everyone, dark magic is not evil.

17:56.030 --> 17:58.810
There have been palace mages 
in the past who used it.

17:59.310 --> 18:01.940
Try not to adopt any negative 
prejudices about it.

18:02.330 --> 18:03.890
This can't be...

18:04.310 --> 18:06.310
I'm a magic prodigy.

18:07.030 --> 18:11.690
So how... How can there be a 
better magic user than me?!

18:11.960 --> 18:15.150
I refuse to accept this!

18:15.150 --> 18:16.780
Oswald!

18:18.890 --> 18:20.700
Yumiella Dolkness.

18:24.250 --> 18:26.580
Your expulsion paperwork is complete.

18:26.850 --> 18:30.090
You are not fit to attend the Royal Academy.

18:30.420 --> 18:33.840
<i>That's what he was doing 
instead of attending class?</i>

18:34.220 --> 18:38.280
Those who lie about their own level 
are not fit for this academy...

18:38.280 --> 18:41.850
no, unfit for the nobility of 
the Kingdom of Valschein.

18:42.340 --> 18:48.050
You will find it difficult to live 
in this kingdom if you are expelled.

18:48.050 --> 18:49.340
I will?

18:49.780 --> 18:53.820
Well, it might not be so bad 
to move to another country.

18:53.820 --> 18:56.740
P-Please wait, Your Highness! Principal!

18:57.130 --> 19:00.410
She is a rare and precious 
user of dark magic.

19:00.410 --> 19:04.750
She destroyed a target that even palace 
mages have difficulty breaking.

19:04.960 --> 19:08.310
She might truly be level 99 after all!

19:08.310 --> 19:12.260
Her expulsion would be a 
great loss to this kingdom!

19:12.500 --> 19:15.320
But a palace mage can break it, right?

19:15.320 --> 19:18.780
So it doesn't prove that she's level 99.

19:18.780 --> 19:23.020
If you want this expulsion revoked, 
you'll need to convince me.

19:26.590 --> 19:29.620
<i>It looks like they really want to expel me,</i>

19:30.040 --> 19:34.180
<i>but wouldn't giving someone as powerful 
as a palace mage to another country</i>

19:34.180 --> 19:36.530
<i>create problems for the royal family,</i>

19:36.530 --> 19:37.940
<i>Prince Edwin?</i>

19:40.760 --> 19:44.720
Miss Yumiella, that spell you used 
wasn't your full strength, was it?

19:44.720 --> 19:47.920
Show them your magic at 
full strength now! Please!

19:49.540 --> 19:52.650
<i>It's hard to refuse when she begs like that.</i>

19:53.960 --> 19:57.550
Very well. I'll unleash 
this spell into the sky.

19:57.850 --> 20:01.690
Prince Edwin, may I use magic?

20:01.690 --> 20:03.430
Do whatever you want.

20:03.920 --> 20:05.690
Are you sure about that?

20:05.690 --> 20:07.160
Just do it already.

20:07.160 --> 20:10.320
But if something happens, 
who'll be held responsible?

20:10.320 --> 20:13.700
Shooting some magic into the 
sky isn't going to do anything.

20:13.700 --> 20:15.440
I'll assume responsibility.

20:16.060 --> 20:18.330
<i>All right. I got his word.</i>

20:18.900 --> 20:22.340
<i>I'll use the strongest dark magic spell</i>

20:22.340 --> 20:25.450
<i>that only the Demon Lord and 
I could use in the game.</i>

20:27.140 --> 20:31.460
<i>But... it's probably a bad idea 
to actually use my full strength.</i>

20:31.720 --> 20:34.260
<i>I'll hold back just enough.</i>

20:36.240 --> 20:37.460
Black Hole.

21:00.440 --> 21:01.220
What is that?!

21:01.220 --> 21:02.380
That darkness in the sky!

21:02.380 --> 21:03.700
The sun disappeared!

21:04.840 --> 21:06.390
<i>Black Hole.</i>

21:06.390 --> 21:08.480
<i>A spell that unconditionally erases</i>

21:08.480 --> 21:11.690
<i>all matter within a given range by 
controlling the gravitational field.</i>

21:12.210 --> 21:14.990
<i>In other words, as the spell expands,</i>

21:14.990 --> 21:17.590
<i>even the air within its 
range is being eliminated,</i>

21:17.590 --> 21:20.560
<i>and now it's become a perfect vacuum</i>

21:20.560 --> 21:24.970
<i>as the air surrounding it sucks 
everything in with tremendous power.</i>

21:53.780 --> 21:55.550
How was that, Your Highness?

21:55.550 --> 22:00.500
Are you convinced that I'm level 99 now?

22:04.780 --> 22:09.970
<b>The Hidden Boss Shows Her True Strength</b>
